<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <title>폴리오 - 관리</title>
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/manage.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/calendar.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/sidebar.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/management.css">
    </head>
    <body class="managementApp" data-view="detail">
        <div class="appShell">{{> layout/sidebar}}
            <main class="mainArea">
                <div class="topBar"></div>
                <section class="notebook">{{> layout/bookLayout}}
                    <section class="leftPage">
                        <header class="managementIntro">
                            <div class="managementHeading">
                                <h1>관리 :</h1>
                                <label class="dynamicToggle">유동적 화면
                                    <input id="showEmpty" type="checkbox" checked role="switch">
                                    <span>켜기</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <p>주기적으로 돌아오는 일정을 모아서 관리합니다.</p>
                            <p class="tip" id="weeklyBrief">이번 주 일정을 확인하고 있어요.</p>
                        </header>
                        <nav class="categoryLinks">
                            <a href="/index">← 관리</a>
                            <a href="/category?category=health">건강</a>
                            <a href="/category?category=subscription">구독</a>
                            <a href="/category?category=relationship">교제</a>
                            <a href="/category?category=daily">일상</a>
                        </nav>
                        <article class="largeMemo">
                            <img id="detailMemo" class="memoImage" src="/img/memo-health.png" alt="">
                            <img id="detailTape" class="categoryTape" src="/img/tape-blue.png" alt="">
                            <span id="detailCategory" class="categoryName">건강</span>
                            <a class="detailIcon" href="/index" aria-label="관리 화면으로 돌아가기">☰</a>
                            <div id="detailList" class="detailList"></div>
                        </article>
                        <button id="addRule" class="subtleButton">관리 일정 등록</button>
                    </section>
                    <section class="rightPage editorPage">
                        <form id="ruleForm" hidden>
                            <div class="editorHeading">
                                <h2 id="editorTitle">관리 일정</h2>
                                <button type="button" id="closeEditor" aria-label="편집 닫기">×</button>
                            </div>
                            <p class="muted">시작일부터 설정한 주기마다 캘린더에 자동 등록됩니다.</p>
                            <input id="ruleId" type="hidden">
                            <label>일정 이름
                                <input id="ruleTitle" required maxlength="100" placeholder="예: 치과 스케일링">
                            </label>
                            <label>카테고리<select id="ruleCategory">
                                    <option value="health">건강</option>
                                    <option value="subscription">구독</option>
                                    <option value="relationship">교제</option>
                                    <option value="daily">일상</option>
                                </select>
                            </label>
                            <label>시작 날짜
                                <input id="ruleStart" type="date" required min="2001-01-01" max="2100-12-31">
                            </label>
                            <div class="cycleFields">
                                <label>반복 간격
                                    <input id="ruleInterval" type="number" min="1" max="365" value="1"
                                        required>
                                </label>
                                <label>단위<select id="ruleUnit">
                                        <option value="DAY">일</option>
                                        <option value="WEEK">주</option>
                                        <option value="MONTH" selected>개월</option>
                                        <option value="YEAR">년</option>
                                    </select>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <p class="muted">월말·윤년은 해당 월의 마지막 날에 등록됩니다. 수정·삭제 시 과거 일정과 완료 기록은 보존합니다.</p>
                            <button id="saveRule" type="submit">저장</button>
                            <a id="calendarLink" href="/main">캘린더 보기 →</a>
                            <p id="formStatus" role="status"></p>
                        </form>
                    </section>
                </section>
            </main>
        </div>
        <p id="appStatus" class="appStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <script src="/js/management.js" defer></script>
    </body>
</html>
